  "title": "VIZSLA SILVER APPOINTS GUILLERMO HERNANDEZ AS VICE PRESIDENT, EXPLORATION & PROMOTES JESUS VELADOR TO CHIEF GEOLOGIST - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "VANCOUVER, CANADA (May 21, 2026) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G31) (“Vizsla Silver” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce the appointment of Guillermo Hernandez as Vice President of Exploration for Vizsla Silver. Mr. Hernandez has held senior leadership roles with Lundin Gold, Luca Mining and Outcrop Silver, bringing 20 years of international mineral exploration expertise. […]",
